# Certified — REST API Documentation

> **Certified** is a Laravel-based full-stack educational and certification platform.
> Its REST-style API provides structured backend access to courses, categories, instructors, lessons, exams, questions, answers, enrollments, reviews, certificates, results, and contact messages.
>
> The API is designed around consistent CRUD operations, server-side validation, relational integrity, business-rule enforcement, controlled API Resources, file lifecycle management, search/filter functionality, and frontend integration.

---

# 1. API Overview

The Certified API represents the backend communication layer of the platform.

It provides structured endpoints for managing and retrieving the platform's main educational entities.

### Main API capabilities

* Resource listing
* Single-resource retrieval
* Resource creation
* Resource updating
* Resource deletion
* Server-side validation
* Foreign-key existence validation
* Duplicate-record prevention
* Business-rule validation
* File upload management
* File replacement and deletion
* Course search
* Course filtering
* Automatic lesson ordering
* Certificate verification
* Structured JSON responses
* API Resource transformation
* Frontend/API integration
* Postman-based testing

