## 13.2 Instructor Data

```text
name
email
bio
image
phone
status
```

Example:

```json
{
    "Identity💎": 1,
    "Name👤": "Dr. Maya Ibrahim",
    "Email📩": "maya.ibrahim@example.com",
    "BIO📋": "Artificial Intelligence instructor specializing in machine learning...",
    "Image🖼️": "instructors/example.jpg",
    "Phone🛡️": "01276543210",
    "Status🚀": "1"
}
```

---

## 13.3 Instructor Validation

Creation validates:

```text
name       → required / string / length
email      → required / valid email / unique
bio        → required / string
phone      → required / string / length
image      → required / image / supported formats / max 2 MB
status     → required
```

### Update-specific uniqueness

When updating an instructor's email, the current instructor is excluded from the unique-email check.

Conceptually:

```text
unique email
      +
ignore current instructor
```

This allows an instructor to retain their existing email while still preventing duplicate emails across other instructor records.

---

## 13.4 Instructor Image Lifecycle

```text
Create
   ↓
Validate Image
   ↓
Store in instructors/
   ↓
Save Path
```

When replacing an image:

```text
Old Image
   ↓
Delete
   ↓
New Image
   ↓
Store
```

When deleting an instructor, the associated stored image is also deleted.

