## 18.1 Enrollment Relationships

An enrollment connects:

```text
User
 +
Course
```

The API validates:

```text
user_id   → users.id
course_id → courses.id
```

---

## 18.2 Enrollment Status

The enrollment workflow supports statuses including:

```text
pending
active
completed
```

---

## 18.3 Duplicate Enrollment Prevention

The API prevents duplicate enrollment relationships for the same user and course.

Conceptually:

```text
User A
+
Course B
=
One Enrollment
```

Before creating or changing an enrollment, the API checks for an existing conflicting relationship.

A duplicate operation is rejected with:

```text
422
```

This protects the relational integrity of the enrollment system.

