```

### Replacement lifecycle

```text
Existing File
      ↓
Delete
      ↓
Upload Replacement
      ↓
Save New Path
```

### Deletion lifecycle

```text
Database Record
      ↓
Delete Associated File
      ↓
Delete Database Record
```

This approach keeps database records and uploaded assets synchronized.

