| Submit invalid data          |                              422 |
| Update existing resource     |                              200 |
| Delete existing resource     |                              200 |
| Delete non-existing resource |                              404 |
| Invalid foreign key          |                              422 |
| Duplicate enrollment         |                              422 |
| Duplicate review             |                              422 |
| Exceed exam total marks      |                              422 |
| Invalid image                |                              422 |
| Invalid image size           |                              422 |
| Invalid video URL            |                              422 |
| Course search                |                              200 |
| Popular filter               |                              200 |
| Free filter                  |                              200 |
| New filter                   |                              200 |
| Certificate verification     | Successful verification response |

